sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant p0 as Merchant
    participant p1 as Payment API
    participant p2 as Idempotency DB
    participant p3 as Provider
    participant p4 as Webhook Intake
    participant p5 as Ledger
    p0->>p1: Request with stable idempotency key
    p1->>p2: Claim key atomically
    p1->>p3: Create or capture via provider key
    p3->>p1: Result or uncertain timeout
    p1->>p2: Store final or pending state
    p1->>p0: Return prior state on retry
    p3->>p4: Authenticated webhook event
    p4->>p5: Dedup then post exactly one ledger effect
